docs/site/src/content/docs/effects/spotlight.mdx:94:An agent sets `spotlight` with `set_video`, as an object of `shape` (`rect` or `ellipse`), `x`, `y`, `width`, `height`, `feather`, `dim` and `zoom`, and `null` takes the spotlight off. It isn't held to the fields' limits for placing a spotlight: it can set any centre, any size above 0 and any `feather` of 0 or more. `dim` runs from 0 to 1 rather than as a percentage, and `zoom` from 1 to 2. See [Tools: picture and grade](/mcp/tools-set-video/#spotlight).
